{"seq":3,"slug":"medical-imaging","title":"大学临床医学 — 医学影像学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/clinical-medicine/diagnostics/medical-imaging","wordCount":1985,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学临床医学-医学影像学\">大学临床医学 — 医学影像学</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>医学影像学利用 X 线、超声、CT、MRI 和核医学等技术在无创或微创条件下显示人体内部结构和功能状态，是现代临床诊断不可或缺的&quot;第三只眼&quot;。不同成像模态各有优势和局限——选择正确的检查方法（而非默认开具最贵的检查）是影像诊断素养的核心。理解每种模态的成像原理是正确解读图像和规避伪影的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"x-线成像\">X 线成像</h3><p>X 线是最早的医学影像技术（1895 年伦琴发现），至今仍是骨骼和胸部检查的一线方法。成像原理基于 X 线穿透人体后被不同组织差异性衰减：骨骼（高密度，白色）&gt; 软组织 &gt; 脂肪 &gt; 气体（低密度，黑色）。</p>\n<p>X 线影像上的密度由高到低分为四种基本密度：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>密度</th>\n<th>代表组织</th>\n<th>影像表现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>骨/钙化密度</td>\n<td>骨骼、钙化灶</td>\n<td>白色（高密度影）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>软组织密度</td>\n<td>实质脏器、肌肉、血液</td>\n<td>灰白色</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>脂肪密度</td>\n<td>皮下脂肪、腹膜后脂肪</td>\n<td>灰黑色</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>气体密度</td>\n<td>肺、胃肠道气体</td>\n<td>黑色（低密度影）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>胸部 X 线</strong>是最常做的影像检查。正常胸片的系统读片流程：骨骼→软组织→纵隔→肺门→肺野→膈肌→肋膈角→心影。</p>\n<p>心胸比（cardiothoracic ratio, CTR）= 心影最大横径 / 胸廓最大横径。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CTR &gt; 0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span>（正位片）提示心脏增大。胸腔积液在直立位胸片上的最早征象是肋膈角变钝（积液量约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>200</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>300</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>mL</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">200\\text{-}300\\,\\text{mL}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">300</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mL</span></span></span></span></span></span> 时可见）；大量积液时患侧呈均匀高密度影，纵隔向健侧移位。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ct-成像\">CT 成像</h3><p>CT（computed tomography）通过 X 线管围绕人体旋转采集多角度数据，经计算机重建为横断面图像，消除了普通 X 线的结构重叠问题。CT 值以 Hounsfield 单位（HU）量化组织密度：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组织</th>\n<th>CT 值（HU）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>骨骼</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>400</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+400</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">400</span></span></span></span></span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+1000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>软组织</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>60</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+60</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">60</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>水</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>脂肪</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-50</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">50</span></span></span></span></span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空气</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-1000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>增强 CT</strong>：静脉注射碘对比剂后扫描，利用血供差异区分正常组织与病变。动脉期（注射后 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>25</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">25\\text{-}30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span></span></span></span></span> s）显示富血供病灶（如肝细胞癌的&quot;快进快出&quot;强化模式），门脉期（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>70</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">60\\text{-}70</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">70</span></span></span></span></span> s）显示肝实质和门静脉，延迟期（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\text{-}5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> min）显示胆管癌等纤维化病灶的延迟强化。</p>\n<p><strong>高分辨率 CT（HRCT）</strong>：薄层（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>2</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>mm</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\text{-}2\\,\\text{mm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mm</span></span></span></span></span></span>）+ 骨算法，是评估肺间质病变（肺纤维化、支气管扩张）的金标准。</p>\n<p>常见急症的 CT 表现：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>疾病</th>\n<th>CT 特征</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>急性脑出血</td>\n<td>脑实质内高密度灶（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>80</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>HU</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50\\text{-}80\\,\\text{HU}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">80</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">HU</span></span></span></span></span></span>），周围低密度水肿带</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>急性脑梗死（早期）</td>\n<td>CT 平扫可能正常（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span></span> h 内），灌注 CT 可显示缺血半暗带</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>急性肺栓塞</td>\n<td>CTPA 示肺动脉内充盈缺损</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>急性阑尾炎</td>\n<td>阑尾增粗（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>6</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>mm</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 6\\,\\text{mm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mm</span></span></span></span></span></span>）、周围脂肪条纹征、粪石</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"mri-成像\">MRI 成像</h3><p>MRI（magnetic resonance imaging）利用强磁场激发人体氢质子的共振信号成像，无电离辐射，软组织分辨率优于 CT。两种基本加权序列：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>序列</th>\n<th>水/CSF 信号</th>\n<th>脂肪信号</th>\n<th>主要用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>WI</td>\n<td>低信号（暗）</td>\n<td>高信号（亮）</td>\n<td>解剖结构显示，增强后病灶显示</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>WI</td>\n<td>高信号（亮）</td>\n<td>中等信号</td>\n<td>病变检出（水肿、炎症、肿瘤）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>记忆口诀：<strong>&quot;<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 看解剖、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 看病变&quot;</strong>。水在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>WI 上呈高信号，因此水肿、囊肿、脑脊液在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 上&quot;发亮&quot;，容易识别。</p>\n<p>MRI 的特殊序列：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>DWI（弥散加权成像）</strong>：检测水分子扩散受限。急性脑梗死在 DWI 上数分钟内即呈高信号（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ADC</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 值降低），远早于常规 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>WI 改变——是急性卒中诊断的最敏感序列</li>\n<li><strong>FLAIR（液体衰减反转恢复）</strong>：抑制脑脊液信号，使脑室旁和皮层下病变更清晰</li>\n<li><strong>MRA（磁共振血管成像）</strong>：无需对比剂即可显示颅内血管，用于动脉瘤筛查</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[临床问题] --&gt; B{首选影像}&#10;    B --&gt;|急性卒中| C[CT 平扫排除出血 → DWI 确认梗死]&#10;    B --&gt;|脊髓病变| D[MRI: T2WI + 增强]&#10;    B --&gt;|骨折| E[X 线 ± CT]&#10;    B --&gt;|腹部急症| F[CT 增强]&#10;    B --&gt;|乳腺筛查| G[乳腺 X 线 ± 超声 ± MRI]&#10;    B --&gt;|胎儿评估| H[超声为首选, MRI 补充]\">graph TD\n    A[临床问题] --&gt; B{首选影像}\n    B --&gt;|急性卒中| C[CT 平扫排除出血 → DWI 确认梗死]\n    B --&gt;|脊髓病变| D[MRI: T2WI + 增强]\n    B --&gt;|骨折| E[X 线 ± CT]\n    B --&gt;|腹部急症| F[CT 增强]\n    B --&gt;|乳腺筛查| G[乳腺 X 线 ± 超声 ± MRI]\n    B --&gt;|胎儿评估| H[超声为首选, MRI 补充]</pre><h3 id=\"超声成像\">超声成像</h3><p>超声（ultrasonography）利用高频声波在组织界面反射的回声成像，具有实时、无辐射、便携和经济的优势。</p>\n<p>超声分类：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>B 超（灰阶成像）</strong>：最基础的模式，适用于肝胆胰脾肾、甲状腺、子宫附件、浅表软组织检查</li>\n<li><strong>彩色多普勒</strong>：叠加血流信息，红色表示朝向探头的血流、蓝色表示远离探头的血流。用于评估血管通畅性（下肢深静脉血栓筛查）和心脏血流（超声心动图）</li>\n<li><strong>超声心动图（心超）</strong>：评估心脏结构（瓣膜、室壁运动、心包积液）和功能（射血分数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">EF</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span> = <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>E</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{EDV - ESV}{EDV} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2173em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span>），是心力衰竭和瓣膜病的核心影像工具</li>\n</ul>\n<p>超声的主要局限：受操作者依赖性大、肥胖和肠气干扰明显、对含气器官（肺）和骨骼内部结构显示差。</p>\n<h3 id=\"核医学基础\">核医学基础</h3><p>核医学通过注射放射性示踪剂（如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>99</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow></msup><mi>T</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^{99m}Tc</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">99</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mn>18</mn></msup><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^{18}F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">18</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span>-FDG）在体外探测其在体内的分布来反映<strong>功能和代谢</strong>信息，而非纯粹的解剖结构。</p>\n<p><strong>PET-CT</strong>（正电子发射断层扫描 + CT）是肿瘤分期和疗效评估的利器。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mn>18</mn></msup><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^{18}F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">18</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span>-FDG 是葡萄糖类似物，恶性肿瘤因高代谢活性而摄取增加——在 PET 上呈&quot;热点&quot;。标准化摄取值（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>U</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SUV</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span>）是半定量指标，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>U</mi><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>2.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SUV_{max} &gt; 2.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.5</span></span></span></span></span> 通常提示恶性可能。PET-CT 在肺癌分期中可同时发现远处转移灶（骨、肝、肾上腺），改变约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30%</span></span></span></span></span> 患者的治疗决策。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>一位急诊胸痛患者，CT 肺动脉造影（CTPA）显示右肺动脉主干内充盈缺损。请判断诊断，并解释为什么选择 CTPA 而非普通胸片或 MRI 作为首选检查。</li>\n<li>一位突发偏瘫 1 小时的患者，头颅 CT 平扫未见异常高密度灶。能否排除脑梗死？下一步应做什么检查？请从 DWI 的成像原理出发解释。</li>\n<li>比较 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>WI 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>WI 上脑脊液的信号强度差异，并解释为什么急性脑出血在两种序列上的信号会随时间变化。</li>\n<li>一位甲状腺结节患者，超声报告描述&quot;实性低回声结节，边界不规则，纵横比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，微钙化&quot;。这些特征各自意味着什么？综合来看，该结节的恶性风险如何？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Herring&#39;s Learning Radiology</strong>：入门级影像学教材，按&quot;识别异常&quot;的思路组织内容，适合初学者。</li>\n<li><strong>Fundamentals of Diagnostic Radiology</strong>（Brant and Helms）：系统性参考教材，覆盖所有影像模态。</li>\n<li><strong>Radiopaedia.org</strong>：全球最大的开放影像学教育平台，病例库包含 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>60</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 60,000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span></span></span></span></span> 例，可按疾病或模态检索。</li>\n<li><strong>Radiology Assistant</strong>（radiologyassistant.nl）：荷兰放射学教学网站，以图文结合的教程形式讲解常见影像征象，系统性强。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>影像诊断的选择遵循&quot;先简后繁、先无创后有创&quot;原则：X 线用于骨折和胸部初筛，CT 是急症和复杂解剖的主力，MRI 在软组织分辨率和功能成像上独具优势，超声凭借实时性和零辐射成为床旁首选，PET-CT 提供代谢维度的信息用于肿瘤全身评估。每种模态都有其最佳适应证和固有盲区——掌握&quot;什么情况用什么检查&quot;比记住所有影像征象更具临床价值。当影像发现异常时，永远要回到患者——影像只是诊断链中的一环，最终的临床决策需要将影像、实验室和体格检查结果整合为完整的临床叙事。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学临床医学 — 医学影像学","id":"大学临床医学-医学影像学"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"X 线成像","id":"x-线成像"},{"level":3,"text":"CT 成像","id":"ct-成像"},{"level":3,"text":"MRI 成像","id":"mri-成像"},{"level":3,"text":"超声成像","id":"超声成像"},{"level":3,"text":"核医学基础","id":"核医学基础"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学临床医学 — 实验室诊断","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/clinical-medicine/diagnostics/laboratory-diagnostics"},"next":null}